{"id":"1a68274b0453bca0","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family.md","title":"ZFC Card6 Almost Disjoint Family","display":"df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Card6 Almost Disjoint Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family"],"display":"df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Card6 Almost Disjoint Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-equinumerous]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card6-almost-disjoint-family — ZFC Card6 Almost Disjoint Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"58-df-equinumerous\">58-df-equinumerous</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span> (base set and family of countably infinite subsets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lvert\\cdot\\rvert\">\\(\\lvert\\cdot\\rvert\\)</span> (cardinality operation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S\\)</span> (equinumerosity predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6AlmostDisjointFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6AlmostDisjointFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\omega)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to |A\\cap B|&lt;\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card6\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard6AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,\\omega)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to |A\\cap B|&lt;\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard countable-support variant: members are countably infinite and distinct members have finite intersection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-equinumerous]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08